plans do not physically fit, and a heads-up notification when it is time to head out the door.\n\nGET THERE YOUR WAY\nEvery plan can be reached by driving, walking, or public transit. Pick the mode on the travel leg and everything follows it - leave-by times, notifications, the Lock Screen countdown, and the Directions button, which opens Apple Maps or Google Maps in the right mode. Transit estimates are door to door, so the walk to the station is already counted.\n\nERRANDS WITHOUT A SCHEDULE\nSome days you just need to hit the gym, stop by your parents, and grab groceries - no set times. Mark a plan as Anytime and it sits on the day's Whenever shelf as a simple check-off list. When you are ready, Plan my loop finds the fastest order to run every errand from home, checks traffic across the whole day, and picks the cheapest window that fits around your scheduled plans. Planning just one stop? Ask When should I go? and get the same answer for a single errand. One tap schedules the loop onto your timeline.\n\nWIDGETS THAT KEEP SCORE\nThe Today widget shows your progress, your next leave-by time, and the day's route map. The Errands widget lists the Whenever shelf with tappable circles so you can check things off without opening the app. Lock Screen widgets and a Live Activity countdown are there too.\n\nTRIPS, START TO FINISH\nBuild a day-by-day itinerary with lodging, flights, hikes, and food. Every day gets a map and travel legs between stops. Road trips work the way you would expect - the first drive of the trip starts from your front door. Import GPX files, search national park trails, and share a trip with friends with end-to-end encryption.\n\nA JOURNAL YOU DO NOT HAVE TO WRITE\nAttach photos as you go. Month in Review and Trip Review turn your plans into stats, a map of everywhere you went, and a shareable card for Instagram or Messages.\n\nNo ads. No tracking. Your plans stay yours.\n\nTravel times are estimates. Always double-check routes and times with a maps app before leaving.", "trackCensoredName": "PlanThology", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/planthology/id6779658543?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "averageUserRating": 0, "minimumOsVersion": "26.4", "userRatingCount": 0}]}